// A blast in an ore seam breaks the ore into loose ore, not gravel: rubble a sluice or an ore hopper can recover
// (before the fix every broken ore cell crumbled to gravel and the ore was lost).
map
########################################
#......................................#
#......................................#
#..........rrrrrrrrrrrrrrr.............#
#..........rriiiiiiiiiiirr.............#
#..........rriiiiiiiiiiirr.............#
#..........rriiiiiiiiiiirr.............#
#.@........rrrrrrrrrrrrrrr.............#
########################################
end
explode 5 13 -2 0.5
expect 4 static:IronOre == 33
expect 400 static:IronOre < 10                 // most of the seam broken...
expect 400 count:IronOre > 18                  // ...and over half of it lies about as loose ore
